2024\":[0.00038363531522125,0.00148463783070781,-9.46310508286308e-05,-0.00169061348395859,0.00664179287626593,-0.00110699782818718,0.00776425343541122,-0.0133820770946318],\"2024-2025\":[0.0018392165053726,0.00315813968950501,1.22311269007414e-05,0.00025465833444668,0,0,-0.000512609664597409,-0.00475163599162765]},\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"categoria\",\"name\":\"Categoría\",\"type\":\"character\",\"minWidth\":180,\"sticky\":\"left\"},{\"id\":\"2003-2004\",\"name\":\"2003-2004\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2004-2005\",\"name\":\"2004-2005\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2005-2006\",\"name\":\"2005-2006\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2006-2007\",\"name\":\"2006-2007\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2007-2008\",\"name\":\"2007-2008\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2008-2009\",\"name\":\"2008-2009\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2009-2010\",\"name\":\"2009-2010\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2010-2011\",\"name\":\"2010-2011\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2011-2012\",\"name\":\"2011-2012\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2012-2013\",\"name\":\"2012-2013\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2013-2014\",\"name\":\"2013-2014\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2014-2015\",\"name\":\"2014-2015\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2016-2017\",\"name\":\"2016-2017\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2017-2018\",\"name\":\"2017-2018\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2018-2019\",\"name\":\"2018-2019\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2019-2020\",\"name\":\"2019-2020\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2020-2021\",\"name\":\"2020-2021\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2021-2022\",\"name\":\"2021-2022\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2022-2023\",\"name\":\"2022-2023\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2023-2024\",\"name\":\"2023-2024\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90},{\"id\":\"2024-2025\",\"name\":\"2024-2025\",\"type\":\"numeric\",\"minWidth\":90}],\"defaultPageSize\":8,\"highlight\":true,\"striped\":true,\"dataKey\":\"b324fdaafd6b76c4fa51db7ef0866cc1\"},\"children\":[]},\"class\":\"reactR_markup\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n---\n\n## Nota metodológica\n\nLos paneles se construyen apareando observaciones entre trimestres consecutivos mediante\n`CODUSU` + `NRO_HOGAR` + `COMPONENTE`, con horizonte temporal anual (t1 y t2 separados\npor cuatro trimestres). La ponderación utilizada es `PONDERA_t1`.\n\nLos períodos plurianuales acumulan todos los paneles disponibles dentro del bloque,\nlo que amplía el tamaño efectivo de la muestra y estabiliza las estimaciones en celdas\nde baja frecuencia (especialmente para patrones y TCP calificados).\n\nEl Excel con todas las matrices (absolutas, condicionales y balance) se genera en\n`data/paneles/transiciones_completo.xlsx` al ejecutar `calcular_paneles.R`.\n",
